[node name="LeaseTag" type="Node2D"]

; An unleased floor's cover (D-83). Positions are relative to the floor's top-left, the 160 x 96
; `ui.build.floor_frame`; the build screen draws this over every floor not yet leased, and the whole
; floor is the button. `screen` is the one slot whose colour is the design, not a guide's: the game
; tints the floor with it. Text is drawn at each text slot's height, so resizing a slot resizes its text.
